        <h1> <span role="text"></span><span role="text">Statement of Record</span>
        </h1>
        <p data-start="229" data-end="462"><strong data-start="229" data-end="462">This
            is a website dedicated to documenting, organizing, and preserving a
            factual record of events that are directly connected to ongoing
            legal and court-related matters affecting my life, my work, and my
            ability to defend myself.</strong></p>
        <p data-start="464" data-end="754">This is not a casual or personal
          project. The issues presented here arise from disputes that have
          entered, or are connected to, formal legal processes, where my rights,
          my ideas, and my identity have been <strong data-start="669" data-end="754">challenged
            through patterns of deceit, misrepresentation, and fraudulent
            conduct.</strong></p>
        <p data-start="756" data-end="1058">In multiple instances, I have faced
          barriers to full participation—whether through limited access to
          information, restricted visibility into accusations, or conditions
          that prevent a complete and timely defense. These circumstances raise
          serious concerns regarding transparency and procedural fairness.</p>
        <p class="subtitle"> By maintaining this archive, I assert my right to
          document, to be heard, and to ensure that no part of this record can
          be obscured, altered, or selectively presented without accountability.</p>
        <p class="subtitle"><br>
        </p>
        <p class="subtitle">-Joo-yeon Kim</p>
        <br>
